    "golime_slider_section_BAkAXK": {
      "type": "Golime_Slider_Section",
      "blocks": {
        "slider_mtVzkg": {
          "type": "Slider",
          "settings": {
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_img": "shopify://shop_images/Reddit_Logo_1.avif",
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_title": "<p>evereddie</p>",
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_para_golime": "<p>I just had Go Lime install my new hot water tank, and everything went great. No issues at all, and you can't beat the price. Some people complained about the fan on the hot water tank being super loud, but I don’t have that issue at all. In fact, it’s quieter than my old tank</p>"
          }
        },
        "slider_kDf68N": {
          "type": "Slider",
          "settings": {
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_img": "shopify://shop_images/HomeStars-Logo_Cyan_1_bffd3e8e-30af-47bf-b7c0-39baaf758939.avif",
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_title": "<p>HomeOwner</p>",
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_images_star_img": "shopify://shop_images/star_e0ccfbd2-d7b2-4469-a5d8-4ac7e30e1874.avif",
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_para_golime": "<p>This is the third time I met Ashraf to do the services at my home, everytime the next experience waa wonderful than the previous one, he is extremely knowledgeable and imparts wonderful professionalism. He not only fixed the issues but gave me the tips & advices how to maintain and keep running the systems. He is very courteous, friendly and helpful, I will definitely will recommend him100% for the jobs and want to see him if I have the service calls.</p>"
          }
        },
        "slider_4M4ryp": {
          "type": "Slider",
          "settings": {
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_img": "shopify://shop_images/Review_Us_-_Sticker-squashed_1-removebg-preview_0062e4c6-2afa-435c-9b7a-c12d3d613bfa.webp",
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_title": "<p>Adam Green</p>",
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_images_star_img": "shopify://shop_images/star_e0ccfbd2-d7b2-4469-a5d8-4ac7e30e1874.avif",
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_para_golime": "<p> I just replaced my hot water heater. I stumbled across this company online and read the good reviews. Price was much better than other companies, so I was skeptical. I called Saturday afternoon, confirmed online Saturday night, and the work was completed Sunday afternoon. I have been so impressed with the service from my phone conversation with Juan to the installation by Alireza. Now I can only hope that the product is as good as the price, technicians, and customer service.</p>"
          }
        },
        "slider_kddRXC": {
          "type": "Slider",
          "settings": {
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_img": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_11719.png",
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_title": "<p>HockeyfanCanada</p>",
            "main_Golime_Slider_item_block_box_para_golime": "<p>Finally, purchased today, scheduled installation over the weekend. For comparison I have checked with Home Depot and they quoted $2200 +tax. Rheeem 50 Gallon power vent $1489 is the item they will install, so roughly $700 installation fees. They won’t return the old one. Not sure about Costco pricing, they have $300 Gift Card. I don’t think anyone else would sell less than Go Lime. Thanks.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "slider_mtVzkg",
