            "faq-content-golime-text": "1. Place Your Order",
            "faq-content-golime-para": "<p>Complete checkout for your Hybrid AC, then snap a few photos of your current HVAC setup when our customer-service team calls you. (Takes about two minutes.)<br/><br/></p>",
            "faq-content-golime-text2": "2. Pre-Approval Filed for You",
            "faq-content-golime-para2": "<p>As soon as we receive your photos, we submit your pre-approval to the Home Renovation Savings Program—always within 1–2 business days. ⏳ Typical program approval: 7–10 business days.<br/><br/></p>",
            "faq-content-golime-text3": "3. Schedule & Install",
            "faq-content-golime-para3": "<p>Once the approval lands, we’ll call to lock in an installation date that fits your calendar. Our certified techs handle a clean, code-compliant install.<br/><br/></p>",
            "faq-content-golime-text4": "4. Final Submission",
            "faq-content-golime-para4": "<p>After installation, we upload all photos and documents to finalize your rebate claim. You’ll receive a “Rebate Filed” confirmation.<br/><br/></p>",
            "faq-content-golime-text5": "5. Cheque Arrives",
            "faq-content-golime-para5": "<p>The program provider mails your rebate—up to $7,500—straight to your door. We’ll alert you when it’s on the way. 🎉<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "images_jYC4fk",
        "fa_qs_txBDUY"
      ],
      "name": "Golime Faq",
      "settings": {
        "cfame-topdata-title-golime-text": "Rebates Made Easy, We Do All the Heavy Lifting",
        "cfame-topdata-paradiv-golime-para": "<p>From the first click to the cheque in your mailbox, we handle every form and follow-up. You’ll get short status updates at each milestone, so you’re always in the loop, never in the paperwork.<br/><br/></p>"
      }
    },
